abstract: >-
  Reproducibility artifact for a controlled comparison of CODE, SPEC, and BOTH
  prompt contexts for LLM-generated pytest suites on QuixBugs. The repository
  contains exact prompts, 99 generated test suites, raw Ollama responses,
  generation metadata, evaluation outputs, analysis scripts, and derived
  paper-level results.